WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.080
Speaker 2: Thank you for having me, David.

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:02.080
Appreciate it.

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:05.430
Speaker 1: So yesterday, President Joe Biden
held his first what's called a formal press

00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:07.779
conference in several months.

00:00:07.779 --> 00:00:14.639
And I'm not going to go through each piece
of it because, quite frankly, most of it wasn't

00:00:14.639 --> 00:00:16.710
very interesting.

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:22.060
I do think the incredible double standard
applied by many right wingers on these press

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:25.760
conferences should be mentioned, which is
for months and months.

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:27.310
They were saying, Where's Biden?

00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:28.830
No formal press conference.

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:30.680
He did one yesterday.

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:35.400
The press wouldn't stop asking questions,
and so Biden kept going and going for nearly

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:38.290
two hours, and then they said he was droning
on.

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:40.630
It was a marathon press conference.

00:00:40.630 --> 00:00:41.630
Nearly two hours.

00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:42.630
He talked way too long.

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:47.100
Guys, you can't have it both ways, but the
piece that I want to focus on and I apologize

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:51.870
in advance for those who saw this yesterday
and have already suffered brain damage from

00:00:51.870 --> 00:00:53.140
seeing it.

00:00:53.140 --> 00:00:55.170
I'm going to play for you.

00:00:55.170 --> 00:01:01.190
Maybe the dumbest question I have heard in
the history of journalism, and I know that

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:02.210
that says a lot.

00:01:02.210 --> 00:01:07.280
Certainly, this is the dumbest question asked
of Joe Biden during his presidency.

00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:11.620
The person asking the question is Fox News
reporter Peter Doocy.

00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:16.120
Peter Doocy is always trying to get gotchas
and so on and so forth.

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:20.920
Joe Biden knows this, and yet he calls on
him basically every time.

00:01:20.920 --> 00:01:29.590
I only remember a few instances like this,
specifically where Joe Biden has called on

00:01:29.590 --> 00:01:32.420
Peter Doocy every single time doesn't shy
away from his questions.

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:37.600
Listen to the question that Peter Doocy asked,
Speaker 3: Why are you trying so hard in your

00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:41.610
first year to pull the country so far to the
left?

00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:43.520
Speaker 1: Yeah.

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:44.790
All right.

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:47.060
Let's let Joe Biden first start to answer.

00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:49.310
Then I have a lot to say about this.

00:01:49.310 --> 00:01:52.850
Speaker 3: Well, I'm not.

00:01:52.850 --> 00:01:55.900
I don't know what you consider to be too far
to the left.

00:01:55.900 --> 00:02:00.790
If, in fact, we're talking about making sure
that we had the money for COVID, making sure

00:02:00.790 --> 00:02:06.040
we had the money to put together the bipartisan
infrastructure, making sure we were able to

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:12.020
provide for those things that in fact, would
significantly reduce the burden on working

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:13.020
class people.

00:02:13.020 --> 00:02:14.020
But they can.

00:02:14.020 --> 00:02:15.130
They have to continue to work hard.

00:02:15.130 --> 00:02:18.520
I don't know how that is playing to left,
if you may recall.

00:02:18.520 --> 00:02:23.120
Speaker 1: So, OK, so Joe, Joe Biden hasn't
has an answer for it.

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:30.610
The reason that this question is so dumb is
because the narrative around Biden's extreme

00:02:30.610 --> 00:02:38.170
leftism is so untrue that the left wishes
this was the case.

00:02:38.170 --> 00:02:42.090
Like, I wish Joe Biden was doing more left
wing stuff.

00:02:42.090 --> 00:02:46.660
Think about Biden's major actions during his
first year as president, and this is not like

00:02:46.660 --> 00:02:47.970
a report card.

00:02:47.970 --> 00:02:52.230
It's just evaluating whether the things he
did are really left or not.

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:54.110
He did COVID stimulus now.

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:55.800
Trump did two of them.

00:02:55.800 --> 00:03:01.270
Biden's COVID stimulus is no further left
than Trump's two COVID stimuli.

00:03:01.270 --> 00:03:02.270
Biden did one.

00:03:02.270 --> 00:03:03.270
Trump did, too.

00:03:03.270 --> 00:03:04.270
So that's a major accomplishment.

00:03:04.270 --> 00:03:05.510
He did it relatively quickly.

00:03:05.510 --> 00:03:07.739
Once getting in office, not very far left.

00:03:07.739 --> 00:03:13.480
Number two, The vaccine rollout has been one
of Joe Biden's kind of major actions or proto

00:03:13.480 --> 00:03:16.590
programs during his first year.

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:21.739
If you believe Trump made the vaccines, which
he didn't, but let's imagine that we kind

00:03:21.739 --> 00:03:26.810
of accept this right wing story that that
Trump made the vaccines.

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:32.850
How is distributing the vaccines that your
Republican hero made far left so that that's

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:34.610
not far left?

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:39.880
Joe Biden got a very modest infrastructure
bill passed and remember that for a very long

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:45.410
time, Republicans liked infrastructure spending
to some degree.

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:48.099
And there's nothing particularly far left
about it.

00:03:48.099 --> 00:03:52.840
You know, center centrist governments around
the world do infrastructure.

00:03:52.840 --> 00:03:55.370
Right wing governments around the world do
infrastructure.

00:03:55.370 --> 00:03:57.230
Left wing governments around the world do
infrastructure.

00:03:57.230 --> 00:04:01.040
It's a very modest infrastructure bill, quite
milquetoast.

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:02.950
If I say so myself.

00:04:02.950 --> 00:04:07.730
Getting out of Afghanistan is a major first
year Biden accomplishment.

00:04:07.730 --> 00:04:10.100
That was the Trump plan.

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:15.650
So how is Biden doing the thing that Trump
promised to do?

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:16.650
Far left.

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:19.599
Not seeing anything that matches that description.

00:04:19.599 --> 00:04:25.729
These are the major Biden accomplishments
during year one now just rolling out sending

00:04:25.729 --> 00:04:31.069
for free COVID tests to anybody who asks for
them.

00:04:31.069 --> 00:04:33.219
But you've got to ask for them.

00:04:33.219 --> 00:04:36.879
There is nothing very far left here and a
lot of this.

00:04:36.879 --> 00:04:39.509
So so there's really two stories here.

00:04:39.509 --> 00:04:45.910
One story is the false narrative about Biden
being an extreme leftist.

00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:50.990
I think that Biden ran on a policy that's
like marginally to the left of Barack Obama,

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:55.779
and certainly the implementation has been
extraordinarily center left.

00:04:55.779 --> 00:04:57.490
Nothing remarkable at all.

00:04:57.490 --> 00:04:59.249
And then it's just this.

00:04:59.249 --> 00:05:07.849
Vatican flaccid continued attempt from Peter
Doocy to make himself seem alpha for lack

00:05:07.849 --> 00:05:12.960
of a better term and do a big boy for the
Fox News audience, which I think is kind of

00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:13.960
working for him.

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:18.409
Like I think if the Fox audiences, why are
you trying to move the country so far to the

00:05:18.409 --> 00:05:19.409
left?

00:05:19.409 --> 00:05:23.180
They probably do believe that that's what
Joe Biden is trying to do, even though it

00:05:23.180 --> 00:05:25.229
could not be further from the truth.

00:05:25.229 --> 00:05:32.389
I am having a hard time, and I know Newsmax
and OAN sometimes ask questions of presidents.

00:05:32.389 --> 00:06:02.270
This seems like the dumbest question posed
to a president 

00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:34.439
in 

00:06:34.439 --> 00:06:47.939
a very, very long time.

